		(at 15.705 60.8 90)
		(descr "System-5 36-pin bus edge connector: the 30-pin cards' C30 (busdrv.pretty) with three positions added at each end, 0.1 in pitch, octagonal pads, drill 1.016 mm. Pad k = bus socket position k (docs/manual/bus.md), counted from GND since 2026-11-18: the cards place it with pad 1 at the GND end. The part is a single-row right-angle pin header: its plastic body (drawn on F.Fab) lies on the board between the pads and the card edge, 1.5 to 4.04 mm from the pads, on this footprint's -y side (the card edge, with the bus edge on the left as drawn and the footprint at 90); its pins run on past the edge. Nothing is printed under the body (2026-11-18).")
